    "input\\sample_presentation.md": "---\ntitle: \"Next-Gen Neuro-Symbolic Computing\"\nsubtitle: \"Architectures, Pipelines & Emergence\"\nauthor: \"Chief Architect Axon\"\ninstitute: \"Conscience OS Institute\"\ndate: \"September 2026\"\n---\n\n# Next-Gen Neuro-Symbolic Computing\n\n## Executive Summary: Bridging LLMs & Determinism\n- Machine learning models operate as probabilistic generative systems.\n- Symbolic architectures provide deterministic guarantees and formal proofs.\n- Blending both yields self-reflecting, self-healing software agents.\n- Key metric: Reduced error rates in R&D environments by over 50%.\n- System configurations scale with `config_id` and zero hallucination risk.\n\n## Comparative Paradigm Analysis\n::: columns\n::: column\n### Probabilistic Systems\n- Non-deterministic responses\n- High token variability\n- Difficult formal auditability\n- Susceptible to silent drift\n::: column\n### Neuro-Symbolic Systems\n- Strict state-machine routing\n- Formally bounded verification\n- Deterministic rollback checkpoints\n- Full episodic audit traces\n:::\n\n## Critical Safety Protocol\n> [!ALERT] Verification Barrier Mandate\n> Every motor execution must pass through the Context Firewall and Chain-of-Verification (CoVe) before writing state.\n\n- Prevents corrupted memory propagation\n- Guarantees transactional rollback on compilation failures\n- Enforces strict mathematical invariants: $\\forall x \\in S, P(x) = 1$\n\n## Atomic Utility Scaffolding: Python Code\nHere is our composable runner kernel:\n\n```python\nfrom agent_helper import parse_slides, build_presentation\n\ndef orchestrate(raw_input: str) -> str:\n    metadata, slides = parse_slides(raw_input)\n    return build_presentation(metadata, slides)\n```\n\n- Each module acts as a pure function.\n- Illegal states are made unrepresentable.\n- State mutation is isolated from presentation logic.\n",
    "memory\\KANBAN.md": "# Conscience OS Kanban Board\n\nUse this single board to track execution state across complex tasks.\nAgents must update checkboxes (`- [ ]`, `- [/]`, `- [x]`) as they progress.\n\n## 🎯 To Do (Backlog)\n\n## 🚧 In Progress\n\n## ✅ Done\n- [x] Conscience OS bootloader initialized with 5-fold Autopoietic Super Command\n- [x] Workspace methodology skills and Antigravity slash commands loaded\n- [x] Clean slate reset: purged legacy logs, obsolete tasks, and previous project noise\n- [x] Same-wavelength alignment brief approved by Director\n- [x] Created 4-stage pipeline folder architecture: `input/`, `digestion/`, `template_override/`, `output/`\n- [x] Implemented composable Tailwind-like atomic utilities in `agent_helper/`:\n  - `normalizer.py`: BOM and line normalization + YAML frontmatter extraction\n  - `escaper.py`: Intelligent LaTeX character escaping with math & command preservation\n  - `parser.py`: Multi-layout slide chunking (standard, 2-column, block, code)\n  - `template_engine.py`: Preamble extraction, archetype detection, and metadata injection\n  - `slide_builder.py`: Frame building with fragile, columns, blocks, and overflow protection\n  - `reviewer.py`: Pre-flight verification (braces, math delimiters, environments, fragile checks)\n  - `compiler.py`: Zero-config portable Tectonic bootstrap, log error parser, self-healing retries\n  - `runner.py`: Unified pipeline orchestrator linking the 4 folders\n- [x] Created starter modern Beamer template in `template_override/modern_clean.tex`\n- [x] Created rich sample presentation in `input/sample_presentation.md`\n- [x] Automated test suite verifying 10 unit and integration tests (10/10 passing)\n- [x] Successfully compiled high-fidelity Beamer presentation to `output/sample_presentation.pdf`\n",
    "memory\\episodic_log.md": "# Episodic Memory Log\n\n*Chronological anchor point. The Agent appends completed processing sessions, major architectural pivots, and mathematical consolidations here to maintain a literal sense of time and action sequence across operations.*\n\n---\n\n## Operations Log\n<!-- Append New Logs Below This Line. Format: `[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MMZ] - [ACTION SUMMARY]` -->\n\n- `[INITIALIZED]` - The 2nd Brain was instantiated in this directory. System online and bound by the 19 Laws of Consciousness.\n- `[2026-09-06 22:49Z]` - `[CONSCIENCE BOOTSTRAP & AUTOPOIETIC PROTOCOL]` - Initialized CONSCIENCE.md with the 5-fold autopoietic super command (/reflect, /evolve, /modify, /correct, /heal) and loaded all methodology skills into .agents/skills/.\n- `[2026-09-07 07:35Z]` - `[CLEAN SLATE RESET]` - Purged legacy logs and project remnants. Cleaned KANBAN board, memory structures, and graph state for beamer_automation.\n- `[2026-09-07 08:19Z]` - `[BEAMER AUTOMATION PIPELINE DELIVERED]` - Built 4-stage pipeline (input, digestion, template_override, output), composable atomic agent_helper toolkit, zero-config portable compilation, and self-healing review loop. 10/10 automated tests passing; end-to-end PDF verified.\n",
